---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Senior Living Transition | Sell Your Home Fast | Arkansas Property Buyers"
  description="Moving to assisted living or helping a parent transition? Arkansas Property Buyers makes it easy to sell the family home quickly with a fair cash offer and zero stress."
>

<!-- HEADER -->
<header class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100 sticky top-0 z-50">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between h-16">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 flex-shrink-0">
        <img src="/images/apb icon.png" alt="Arkansas Property Buyers" class="h-10 w-auto object-contain">
        <span class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm tracking-tight">Arkansas Property Buyers</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-7">
        <a href="/#how-it-works" class="font-sub font-bold text-xs text-grey uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-navy transition-colors">How It Works</a>
        <a href="/about"        class="font-sub font-bold text-xs text-grey uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-navy transition-colors">About Us</a>
        <a href="/#testimonials" class="font-sub font-bold text-xs text-grey uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-navy transition-colors">Reviews</a>
        <a href="/blog"          class="font-sub font-bold text-xs text-grey uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-navy transition-colors">Blog</a>
        <a href="tel:+15015047109" class="font-sub font-bold text-sm text-orange flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-gold transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
          (501) 504-7109
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="bg-orange hover:bg-gold text-white font-sub font-bold text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded transition-colors uppercase tracking-wider">Contact Us</a>
      </nav>
      <button onclick="document.getElementById('mobNav').classList.toggle('open')" class="md:hidden p-2 text-grey">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div id="mobNav" class="mob-nav md:hidden border-t border-gray-100">
      <nav class="flex flex-col py-4 gap-1">
        <a href="/#how-it-works" class="py-2 px-1 font-sub font-bold text-xs text-grey uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-navy">How It Works</a>
        <a href="/about"        class="py-2 px-1 font-sub font-bold text-xs text-grey uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-navy">About Us</a>
        <a href="/#testimonials" class="py-2 px-1 font-sub font-bold text-xs text-grey uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-navy">Reviews</a>
        <a href="/blog"         class="py-2 px-1 font-sub font-bold text-xs text-grey uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-navy">Blog</a>
        <a href="tel:+15015047109" class="py-2 px-1 font-sub font-bold text-sm text-orange">(501) 504-7109</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="mt-2 bg-orange text-white font-sub font-bold text-xs px-4 py-2.5 rounded text-center uppercase tracking-wider">Contact Us</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- INFO BANNER -->
<div class="bg-navy text-white px-5 py-2.5 text-center">
  <p class="font-sub font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
    We help Arkansas families simplify the real estate side of senior living transitions &ndash;
    <a href="tel:+15015047109" class="text-orange hover:text-gold transition-colors ml-1 underline underline-offset-2">(501) 504-7109</a>
  </p>
</div>

<!-- MAIN CONTENT: 2-column sticky layout -->
<div class="bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_400px] gap-12 lg:gap-14 items-start">

      <!-- ═══ LEFT COLUMN: all scrollable content ═══ -->
      <div>

        <!-- HERO CONTENT -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-4">Family-Owned &amp; Serving Arkansas for Over 30 Years</p>
          <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase leading-tight text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-4">Helping Arkansas Families Navigate Senior Living Transitions</h1>
          <p class="tagline-script mb-5">You don't have to handle everything alone.</p>
          <p class="font-body text-grey text-base leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-lg">Whether you're helping a loved one move into assisted living, independent living, or memory care – or simply downsizing to a more manageable home – we're here to help simplify the real estate side of the process. For more than 30 years, our family-owned Arkansas company has helped families navigate important life transitions with honesty, compassion, and practical solutions.</p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 mb-8">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-sub font-bold text-navy text-xs">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              No repairs or cleanout required
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-sub font-bold text-navy text-xs">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              Flexible timelines that work for your family
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-sub font-bold text-navy text-xs">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              Local Arkansas family, not a national company
            </div>
          </div>

          <a href="#lead-form" class="lg:hidden inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-orange hover:bg-gold text-white font-sub font-bold text-sm px-7 py-3.5 rounded transition-colors uppercase tracking-wider w-full sm:w-auto">
            Schedule a Conversation &darr;
          </a>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-gray-100 mb-12">

        <!-- CHALLENGES SECTION -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">We Understand What You're Facing</p>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight mb-5">The Challenges Families Face</h2>
          <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">A senior living transition is rarely just about real estate. It's an emotional process – often involving difficult decisions, family coordination, and a property filled with decades of memories. If any of the following sounds familiar, you're not alone.</p>

          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">A parent can no longer safely live alone</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Health concerns are increasing and a move is needed soon</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">The home has decades of belongings to sort through</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">The property needs repairs before it could be listed</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Family members live out of state and coordination is difficult</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Multiple family members are involved in the decision</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3.5 sm:col-span-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">The whole situation feels emotionally and logistically overwhelming</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed mt-6">Many families are already emotionally exhausted by the time they think about the property. We're here to take that piece off your plate – so you can focus on what matters most.</p>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-gray-100 mb-12">

        <!-- HOW WE HELP SECTION -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">What We Do</p>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight mb-5">Making the Transition Easier</h2>

          <div class="space-y-4 font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
            <p>A senior living transition involves a lot of moving parts – and the property is often the most complicated one. We help simplify that piece so your family can move forward with less stress and more clarity.</p>
            <p>We work around your timeline, not ours. Whether you need to move quickly or need time to coordinate across family members, we meet you where you are.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Sell As-Is – No Repairs Required</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We purchase properties in any condition. There's no need to spend time or money on repairs, updates, or cleaning before we can make an offer.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">No Major Cleanout Required</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">You don't have to empty every room before talking with us. We can help connect you with estate sale professionals, donation services, and senior move managers who specialize in these transitions – so the entire process is handled, not just the real estate.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Flexible Timelines</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Move at a pace that works for your family. We can close quickly when needed or give you the time to coordinate a thoughtful transition. You set the pace.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Local Guidance From People Who Know Arkansas</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We've been working with Arkansas families for over 30 years. We understand local communities, local resources, and the kinds of situations families here actually face.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5 border-orange/30 bg-orange/5">
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">A Simple Process That Reduces Stress</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Our goal is to make the real estate side of this transition as simple as possible. One conversation, an honest offer, and a clear path forward – without the uncertainty of listings, showings, and waiting.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 p-5 bg-navy rounded-xl flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <p class="font-sub font-bold text-white text-sm">Have questions? We're glad to walk through your situation.</p>
            <a href="#lead-form" class="flex-shrink-0 bg-orange hover:bg-gold text-white font-sub font-bold text-xs px-5 py-2.5 rounded transition-colors uppercase tracking-wider">Talk to Our Team &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-gray-100 mb-12">

        <!-- STORYTELLING SECTION -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">Situations We've Helped With</p>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight mb-3">Families We've Walked Alongside</h2>
          <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">Every family's situation is different. Here are a few of the circumstances that have brought Arkansas families to our door over the years.</p>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
            <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">A Daughter Helping Her Mother Move to Assisted Living</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">An adult daughter reached out after her mother had moved into assisted living. The family home was full of furniture and personal belongings, and no one had the time or energy to manage a traditional sale. We helped the family understand their options, connected them with local estate sale professionals for the contents, and purchased the property as-is – taking the property completely off her plate so she could focus on her mother's care.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">A Family Managing a Parent's Home From Out of State</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Three adult siblings living in different states were trying to coordinate the sale of their father's home in Arkansas after he transitioned into memory care. Managing a traditional listing from a distance – coordinating repairs, showings, and negotiations – felt impossible. They reached out to us looking for a simpler path. We made the process manageable from start to finish, communicating clearly with all three siblings and closing on a timeline that worked for everyone.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">A Senior Ready for Less Home Maintenance</h3>
              </div>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">A homeowner in her late seventies had lived in her home for more than forty years. The house had become more than she wanted to manage – the yard, the upkeep, the repairs. She wasn't in crisis, she just wanted freedom. She was concerned about the repairs the home needed and wasn't sure a traditional sale made sense. We bought the home as-is, gave her a simple, no-surprise closing, and she walked away with the proceeds to fund the next chapter she'd been looking forward to.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-gray-100 mb-12">

        <!-- WHY WORK WITH APB -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">Why Families Choose Us</p>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight mb-8">Why Work With Arkansas Property Buyers</h2>

          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/><path d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Family-Owned Arkansas Company</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We're local people helping local families. Not a national investment fund, not an out-of-state buyer – just an Arkansas family that has been serving Arkansas homeowners for more than 30 years.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">More Than 30 Years of Experience</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We've helped Arkansas homeowners navigate important life transitions for three decades. We've seen a wide range of situations and we know how to help families move forward.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Compassionate Approach</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Every family's situation is unique, and we treat it that way. We take time to understand what you're dealing with and offer guidance that actually fits your circumstances.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">No Pressure. Ever.</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Our goal is to help you understand your options so you can make the decision that's right for your family. There's no pressure to move forward until you're ready – that's not how we operate.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">We Look for Win-Win Outcomes</h3>
